SF0085 Constitutional enforcement of localities.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Ide, French, Laursen, D, McKeown and
Smith, D and Representative(s) Locke, Pendergraft and
Wharff
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; requiring specified funds
to be withheld from counties, cities and towns violating state law or the
Wyoming constitution; requiring the attorney general to investigate and take
action on violations of law by counties, cities and towns; requiring notice;
requiring requests by a legislator; and providing for an effective date.
